<section class="phero"><div class="wrap"><p class="kicker">Accessibility</p><h1 class="t1 rise">A website people can use.</h1><p class="lede fade">Our design target is WCAG 2.2 AA. A target is not a completed compliance audit.</p><p class="doc-meta">Last updated November 2, 2026</p></div></section><section class="doc"><div class="wrap doc-grid"><div class="doc-aside"><details class="doc-toc" open><summary class="doc-aside-t">On this page</summary><nav aria-label="Page contents"><a href="#section-0">What we are building for</a><a href="#section-1">Evaluation</a><a href="#section-2">Report a barrier</a></nav></details><p class="doc-aside-t">More</p><nav aria-label="Legal"><a href="{% if theme.role == 'main' %}/pages/legal{% else %}{{ routes.root_url }}?preview_theme_id={{ theme.id }}&amp;view=velani-legal{% endif %}">All legal information</a><a href="{% if theme.role == 'main' %}/pages/nevora-privacy{% else %}{{ routes.root_url }}?preview_theme_id={{ theme.id }}&amp;view=velani-nevora-privacy{% endif %}">NEVORA privacy policy</a></nav></div><div class="doc-body"><section id="section-0"><i>01</i><h2>What we are building for</h2><p>We design the website for readable contrast and text, semantic page structure, keyboard access, visible focus, responsive layouts, descriptive labels and reduced motion.</p></section><section id="section-1"><i>02</i><h2>Evaluation</h2><p>We check the website with automated tools and by hand in desktop and mobile browsers, with a keyboard and with reduced motion. We have not completed a full audit, and an automated result alone does not establish full conformance.</p></section><section id="section-2"><i>03</i><h2>Report a barrier</h2><p>Email <a href="mailto:support@thevelani.com">support@thevelani.com</a> with the page and the task you were trying to complete. Include the device or assistive technology if it helps explain the problem. Do not include unnecessary personal information.</p></section><div class="doc-end"><p class="hkick">Questions</p><p>Write to <a href="mailto:support@thevelani.com">support@thevelani.com</a>, or to VELANI LLC, 1654 Calle Tulipan, Suite 100, San Juan, PR 00927.</p><div class="acts"><a class="pill line" href="{% if theme.role == 'main' %}/pages/contact{% else %}{{ routes.root_url }}?preview_theme_id={{ theme.id }}&amp;view=velani-contact{% endif %}">Contact</a></div></div></div></div></section>
